  "name": "Hydrographic Profiles of the Gulf of Alaska, Bering Sea, Chukchi Sea, and Southeast Coastal Fjords",
  "description": "Contains hydrographic profiles of the Gulf of Alaska, Bering Sea, Chukchi Sea, and Southeast Coastal Fjords. Profiles include salinity, temperature, sigma-t, delta-o, depth and occasionally oxygen, nutrient, chlorophyll, and productivity data.\n\nDeposited content: descriptive metadata only; underlying research data are not included.\n\nPurpose: Obtain hydrographic profiles of the Gulf of Alaska, Bering Sea, Chukchi Sea, and Southeast Coastal Fjords.",
